water for several minutes. Remove contact lenses, if present and easy to do. Continue rinsing. Immediately call a POISON CENTER/ doctor.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sds-sikaceram-690elite.pdf","v":"Revision 05.08.2026, Version 3.0","p":1}}],"storage":[{"label":"Conditions for safe storage","text":"Keep container tightly closed in a dry and well-ventilated place. Store in accordance with local regulations. Further information on stor- : Keep in a dry place. age stability No decomposition if stored and applied as directed.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sds-sikaceram-690elite.pdf","v":"Revision 05.08.2026, Version 3.0","p":3,"pe":4}}],"handling":[{"label":"Advice on protection against fire and explosion","text":"Avoid dust formation. Provide appropriate exhaust ventilation at places where dust is formed.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sds-sikaceram-690elite.pdf","v":"Revision 05.08.2026, Version 3.0","p":3}},{"label":"Advice on safe handling","text":"Avoid exceeding the given occupational exposure limits (see section 8). Do not get in eyes, on skin, or on clothing. For personal protection see section 8. Smoking, eating and drinking should be prohibited in the application area. Follow standard hygiene measures when handling chemical products","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sds-sikaceram-690elite.pdf","v":"Revision 05.08.2026, Version 3.0","p":3}},{"label":"Hygiene measures","text":"Handle in accordance with good industrial hygiene and safety practice. When using do not eat or drink. When using do not smoke. Wash hands before breaks and at the end of workday.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sds-sikaceram-690elite.pdf","v":"Revision 05.08.2026, Version 3.0","p":3}}],"signal_word":{"value":"Danger","text":"Signal word : Danger","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sds-sikaceram-690elite.pdf","v":"Revision 05.08.2026, Version 3.0","p":1}},"ppe":{"respiratory":{"label":"Respiratory protection","text":"In case of inadequate ventilation wear respiratory protection. Respirator selection must be based on known or anticipated exposure levels, the hazards of the product and the safe working limits of the selected respirator. particulate filter P","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sds-sikaceram-690elite.pdf","v":"Revision 05.08.2026, Version 3.0","p":4}},"hands":{"label":"Hand protection","text":"Chemical-resistant, impervious gloves complying with an approved standard should be worn at all times when handling chemical products if a risk assessment indicates this is necessary. Follow AS/NZS 1337.1 Recommended: Butyl rubber, PVC, cotton gloves","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sds-sikaceram-690elite.pdf","v":"Revision 05.08.2026, Version 3.0","p":4}},"eyes":{"label":"Eye protection","text":"Safety glasses","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sds-sikaceram-690elite.pdf","v":"Revision 05.08.2026, Version 3.0","p":4}},"skin_body":{"label":"Skin and body protection","text":"Protective clothing (e.g. safety shoes, long-sleeved working clothing, long trousers) Follow AS 2210:3","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sds-sikaceram-690elite.pdf","v":"Revision 05.08.2026, Version 3.0","p":4}},"engineering_controls":{"label":"Appropriate engineering controls","text":"Avoid dust formation. Provide appropriate exhaust ventilation at places where dust is formed.","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sds-sikaceram-690elite.pdf","v":"Revision 05.08.2026, Version 3.0","p":3}}},"transport_adg":{"un_number":"Not applicable","class":"Not applicable","text":"UN number : Not applicable","s":{"t":"SDS","u":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/c/sds-sikaceram-690elite.pdf","v":"Revision 05.08.2026, Version 3.0","p":8}}}]},"spec":{"ds":{"url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/v/sikaceram-690-elite.pdf","title":"SikaCeram®-690 Elite","edition":"December 2025, Version 07.01","version":"07.01","issued":"December 2025"},"std":[{"citation":"EN 13007","section":"PRODUCT INFORMATION","page":2,"context":"CG2WA according to EN 13007"}]}}